      "content": "\"letting go of everything else\"... that's what i keep thinking about. it's like i'm just tired of the noise and the shame. it would be so much quieter if i just stopped trying to exist in this version of my life. does it ever feel like the only way to actually find peace is to just... give up entirely? to stop the struggle?",
